# Normalise every text file to LF in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows with core.autocrlf=true turns scripts/webhook-demo.sh
# into CRLF and `sh` fails on the carriage returns — which is the first thing a reviewer
# runs. Dockerfiles and SQL have the same problem inside Linux containers.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh      text eol=lf
*.sql     text eol=lf
*.go      text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Makefile  text eol=lf
